+this Coverage D will be for the increased cost
+to elevate, floodproof, relocate, or demolish
+(or any combination of these activities)
+caused by the enforcement of current State
+or local floodplain management ordinances
+or laws. Our payment for eligible demolition
+activities will be for the cost to demolish
