+Actual amount of insurance carried—$400,000
+Amount of the loss—$200,000
+Deductible—$500
+In this example there is no coinsurance
+penalty, because the actual amount of insurance carried meets the required amount. We
+will pay no more than $199,500 ($200,000
+amount of loss minus the $500 deductible).
