+  <div>
+    <div class="guidepl-h4">Introduction</div>
+              <div>This topic contains general information on Fannie Mae’s project standards, including:</div>
+          </div>
+
+                                            <ul class="toc">
+                                      <li><a href="#P4186">Fannie Mae’s Project Risk Overview</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4191">Project Documentation</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4196">Condominium Project Questionnaire</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4201">Project Types</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4206">Project Review Methods</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4211">Waiver of Project Review</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4216">Requirements Applicable to All Properties in a Condo, Co-op, or PUD Project</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4221">Priority of Common Expense Assessments</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4226">Delivery Requirements</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P4231">Expiration for Project Reviews</a></li>
+                                      <li><a href="#P13311">Uniform Appraisal Dataset (UAD) 3.6 Policy</a></li>
+                                  </ul>
+                <hr>
